<section class="issue-section">
  <h2>上週總結（<%= @last_week_summary[:range_start] %> ～ <%= @last_week_summary[:range_end] %>）</h2>

  <div class="summary-bar executive-kpi-row" style="--kpi-columns: 3">
    <div class="stat-item">
      <span class="stat-value"><%= @last_week_summary[:completed_task_count] %></span>
      <span class="stat-label">已完成任務</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <span class="stat-value"><%= @last_week_summary[:completed_stage_count] %></span>
      <span class="stat-label">已完成階段</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item <%= "stat-overdue" if @last_week_summary[:complaint_count].to_i.positive? %>">
      <span class="stat-value"><%= @last_week_summary[:complaint_count] || "—" %></span>
      <span class="stat-label">客訴數</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="freshness-label">
    註：人時燃盡沒有「實際完成日期」欄位，議題完成情形無法納入上週總結；客訴數則依通報日期統計，僅涵蓋專案任務、階段追蹤與客訴。
  </p>
</section>
